  "name": "Brownie Cookies",
  "subtitle": "Two batters baked together for a fudgy, crisp-edged cookie",
  "description": "Combine a brown-sugar chocolate-chip cookie dough with a cocoa batter, layer them, and bake until the center is fully set.",
